---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import anirudhDatabricksImg from '../assets/anirudh-databricks.jpeg';
---

<Layout title="About">
    <main class="max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto px-6 py-8" id="main-content">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent mb-3 animate-on-load">About</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight gradient-text animate-on-load">About</h1>
        <p class="text-text-muted mt-3 text-base max-w-md animate-on-load">
            who I am, what I do, and what I'm into
        </p>

        <div class="mt-10 rounded-xl border border-border-subtle bg-bg-card p-8 animate-on-load">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch gap-8">
            <div class="shrink-0">
                <img
                    src={anirudhDatabricksImg.src}
                    alt="Anirudh at Databricks"
                    class="w-48 h-60 sm:w-60 sm:h-80 rounded-lg object-cover"
                />
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1 min-w-0 text-center flex flex-col justify-center gap-8 sm:h-80">
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
                    <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-accent">Bio</h2>
                    <p class="text-orange-100 font-bold">incoming swe @ t-mobile • member of technical staff - agentic ai @ uiuc</p>
                    <p class="text-text-primary lowercase text-lg">hello my name is anirudh konidala!</p>
                </div>
                <div class="text-orange-100 text-center border border-orange-100 p-4">
                    <p class="font-medium lowercase">uiuc '27</p>
                    <p class="mt-2">claudemaxxer • building ai agents • cloud, data & ai</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <section class="mt-10 rounded-xl border border-border-subtle bg-bg-card p-8 animate-on-load">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">What I do</h2>
            <p class="text-text-secondary mt-3 leading-relaxed">
                I work on <b>agentic AI</b> at the University of Illinois—thinking about how AI agents can code, reason, and use tools (RAG, MCP, LangChain, Cursor, Claude). I've shipped ML and data pipelines in industry (Google Cloud, Azure, Vertex AI) and built RL agents and game environments in research (Unity, PyTorch). I also founded <b>KidsKoding</b>, an edtech platform that taught coding to 1,000+ students.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-10 rounded-xl border border-border-subtle bg-bg-card p-8 animate-on-load">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">What I'm into</h2>
            <p class="text-text-secondary mt-3 leading-relaxed">
                <b>Vibe coding</b> with <span class="text-white font-semibold">Cursor</span>, <span class="text-orange-100 font-bold">Claude Code</span>, and <span class="font-semibold" style="color: #F26207">Replit</span>.
                I enjoy moving fast and iterating with AI. Additionally I like to work on data engineering and Machine Learning with proficiency in tools
                like Google Cloud Platform, Databricks, and PyTorch. I am also interested in education tech and learning sciences
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-10 rounded-xl border border-border-subtle bg-bg-card p-8 text-center animate-on-load">
            <p class="text-orange-100 font-semibold lowercase">building ai agents</p>
            <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mt-2"><b>open to collaborating on ai agents with other UIUC students, alumni, and professors</b></p>
        </section>
    </main>
</Layout>
